+The express surcharge is a flat amount that `explain_fee` adds after the cap has been applied,
+so an express fee can exceed the schedule's cap. On STD-A the cap is 150.00 QAR and the surcharge 15.00 QAR,
+so an express transfer in the top tiers costs 165.00 QAR in fees.
